<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Spanjaard lifts yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>Spanjaard lifts yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended February 28</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - Attrib		  24.9	  vs 18.6</p>
<p>    - Headline		28.7	  vs 19.9</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 11.0	  vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.42	  vs 1.06</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   1.51	  vs 1.14</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.09	  vs 0.08</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   1.42	  vs 1.03</p>
<p>    Turnover		  40.57	 vs 37.40</p>
<p>Div payable May 30</p>
<p>on register May 16</p>
<p>Full name: Spanjaard Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said they anticipated profits on par with those for the period under review will be reported in the new financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
